          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Logs and settings stay on this Mac. MacHub sends nothing anywhere.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Journaux et réglages restent sur ce Mac. MacHub n'envoie rien nulle part."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Looking for what was installed…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recherche de ce qui a été installé…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lowest price": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prix croissant"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "価格の安い順"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "价格从低到高"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MFi controllers": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Manettes MFi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MacHub": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MacHub"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MacHub adds it as it is, from where it is now. Keep the file in place.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MacHub l'ajoute tel quel, là où il se trouve. Laisse le fichier à sa place."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MacHub can't tell whether a specific game supports controllers: no game is marked compatible until it has been checked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MacHub ne peut pas savoir si un jeu précis gère les manettes : aucun jeu n'est marqué compatible tant qu'il n'a pas été vérifié."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MacHub compares the bottle's program folders with how they were before.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MacHub compare les dossiers de programmes de la bouteille avec leur état d'avant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MacHub couldn't open its local sign-in receiver.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MacHub n'a pas pu ouvrir son récepteur de connexion local."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MacHub はローカルのサインイン受信を開始できませんでした。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MacHub 无法打开本地登录接收器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MacHub data": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Données de MacHub"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MacHub didn't recognise this mod's layout for this game.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MacHub n'a pas reconnu l'organisation de ce mod pour ce jeu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MacHub downloads Fabric's profile from meta.fabricmc.net, adds it to the Minecraft Launcher's versions, and adds one profile to launcher_profiles.json after saving a backup copy. Quit the Minecraft Launcher first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MacHub télécharge le profil Fabric depuis meta.fabricmc.net, l'ajoute aux versions du Minecraft Launcher et ajoute un profil à launcher_profiles.json après en avoir sauvegardé une copie. Quitte d'abord le Minecraft Launcher."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MacHub has no mod integration for this game.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MacHub n'a pas d'intégration de mods pour ce jeu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MacHub runs Windows programs with its own Wine, built from the official open-source WineHQ code, plus DXMT and DXVK. Nothing is installed outside MacHub's folders, and Whisky isn't needed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MacHub exécute les programmes Windows avec son propre Wine, compilé à partir du code open source officiel de WineHQ, plus DXMT et DXVK. Rien n'est installé hors des dossiers de MacHub, et Whisky n'est pas nécessaire."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MacHub runs it in a bottle, then adds the program it installs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MacHub l'exécute dans une bouteille, puis ajoute le programme installé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MacHub stopped waiting. If the title still starts, it opens normally.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MacHub a cessé d'attendre. Si le titre finit par démarrer, il s'ouvre normalement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MacHub stopped watching. If the title still starts, it opens normally.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MacHub a cessé de surveiller. Si le titre finit par démarrer, il s'ouvre normalement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MacHub's Windows engine isn't installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le moteur Windows de MacHub n'est pas installé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MacHub's Windows engine isn't ready. See Settings › Windows Engine.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le moteur Windows de MacHub n'est pas prêt. Voir Réglages › Moteur Windows."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Made with engine %@. Update it for engine %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Créé avec le moteur %@. Mets-le à jour pour le moteur %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Manage this game": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gérer ce jeu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Manual import. Assetto Corsa's mod sites have no public download API, so MacHub doesn't search them: open one, download a car or track (.zip), then add it here. MacHub checks the archive, installs only into content/cars or content/tracks, and keeps a copy of anything it replaces.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import manuel. Les sites de mods d'Assetto Corsa n'ont pas d'API de téléchargement publique, donc MacHub n'y cherche pas : ouvre-en un, télécharge une voiture ou un circuit (.zip), puis ajoute-le ici. MacHub vérifie l'archive, installe uniquement dans content/cars ou content/tracks et garde une copie de tout ce qu'il remplace."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Manual import: download a .zip from a community site, MacHub installs it safely and can undo it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import manuel : télécharge un .zip sur un site communautaire, MacHub l'installe en sécurité et peut l'annuler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Membership": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abonnement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
