      }
    },
    "The engine archive couldn't be unpacked: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Impossible de décompresser l'archive du moteur : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine archive doesn't match the expected fingerprint; it was not installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'archive du moteur ne correspond pas à l'empreinte attendue ; elle n'a pas été installée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file downloaded from Valve isn't a Windows installer": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le fichier téléchargé chez Valve n'est pas un installateur Windows"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file was moved or deleted. Download it again or choose it from its new place.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le fichier a été déplacé ou supprimé. Télécharge-le à nouveau ou choisis-le à son nouvel emplacement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The folder goes to the Trash and the one it replaced is put back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le dossier va à la Corbeille et celui qu'il remplaçait est remis en place."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The folder goes to the Trash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le dossier va à la Corbeille."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game has closed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le jeu s'est fermé."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ゲームが終了しました。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏已关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game started, then closed after %lld s: it most likely crashed at startup. See the requirements and the Wine log.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le jeu a démarré puis s'est fermé au bout de %lld s : il a très probablement planté au lancement. Voir les prérequis et le log Wine."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ゲームは起動しましたが %lld 秒で終了しました。起動時にクラッシュした可能性が高いです。必要条件と Wine のログを確認してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏已启动，但 %lld 秒后关闭：很可能在启动时崩溃。请查看前提条件和 Wine 日志。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The installer added these programs. The first one is MacHub's best guess.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'installateur a ajouté ces programmes. Le premier est le choix le plus probable selon MacHub."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The installer closed, but no new program appeared in Program Files. It may have been cancelled, or installed somewhere else: you can choose the program yourself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'installateur s'est fermé, mais aucun nouveau programme n'est apparu dans Program Files. Il a peut-être été annulé ou installé ailleurs : tu peux choisir le programme toi-même."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The installer didn't start": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'installateur n'a pas démarré"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The installer stopped with an error": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'installateur s'est arrêté sur une erreur"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The installer's own window opens on your Mac. Answer its questions and let it finish; MacHub follows it and then shows what it installed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La fenêtre de l'installateur s'ouvre sur ton Mac. Réponds à ses questions et laisse-le finir ; MacHub le suit puis affiche ce qu'il a installé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The launch carries on; its progress stays on the title's page.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le lancement continue ; sa progression reste visible sur la page du titre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The program closed (exit code %d).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le programme s'est fermé (code de sortie %d)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "プログラムが終了しました（終了コード %d）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "程序已关闭（退出代码 %d）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The program is missing from its folder: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le programme est absent de son dossier : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The program itself": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le programme lui-même"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The program's process never appeared.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le processus du programme n'est jamais apparu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sign-in response was invalid and was ignored.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La réponse de connexion était invalide et a été ignorée."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "サインインの応答が無効だったため無視しました。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录响应无效，已忽略。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are the families macOS supports. MacHub lists any controller macOS exposes, but only checks what macOS itself reports.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voici les familles prises en charge par macOS. MacHub liste toute manette exposée par macOS, mais ne vérifie que ce que macOS lui-même indique."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These bottles come from the original Whisky. “Not set up” means Wine never created the bottle's files, so it can't run anything. MacHub never changes them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ces bouteilles viennent du Whisky d'origine. « Non configurée » signifie que Wine n'a jamais créé ses fichiers : elle ne peut rien lancer. MacHub ne les modifie jamais."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これらは旧 Whisky のボトルです。「未設定」は Wine がボトルのファイルを作成していないため、何も起動できない状態です。MacHub がこれらを変更することはありません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些容器来自原版 Whisky。“未配置”表示 Wine 从未创建该容器的文件，因此无法运行任何程序。MacHub 不会修改它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These files are in the mods folder but MacHub didn't install them. It never changes them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ces fichiers sont dans le dossier des mods mais MacHub ne les a pas installés. Il n'y touche jamais."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Whisky is too old for MacHub": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette version de Whisky est trop ancienne pour MacHub"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この Whisky は MacHub には古すぎます"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Whisky 版本过旧，无法用于 MacHub"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This build of MacHub has no runtime manifest.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette version de MacHub n'a pas de manifeste de moteur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This controller doesn't accept vibration from macOS.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette manette n'accepte pas la vibration depuis macOS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This engine version has no msync: esync is used instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette version du moteur n'a pas msync : esync est utilisé à la place."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file is a .%@ archive. MacHub installs .zip files; for others, unpack it and copy it yourself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce fichier est une archive .%@. MacHub installe les fichiers .zip ; pour les autres, décompresse-la et copie-la toi-même."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file isn't a MacHub engine archive": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce fichier n'est pas une archive de moteur MacHub"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This link is for a game MacHub doesn't manage mods for, or that isn't installed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce lien concerne un jeu dont MacHub ne gère pas les mods, ou qui n'est pas installé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This takes about a minute the first time. Nothing else on your Mac changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cela prend environ une minute la première fois. Rien d'autre ne change sur ton Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Threads": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fils d'exécution"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To play, a Whisky bottle with Steam for Windows is needed. See the requirements below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour jouer, il faut une bouteille Whisky avec Steam pour Windows. Voir les prérequis ci-dessous."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "プレイするには、Windows 版 Steam が入った Whisky のボトルが必要です。下の必要条件を確認してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要游玩，需要一个装有 Windows 版 Steam 的 Whisky 容器。请查看下方前提条件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To play, set up Steam for Windows in Settings › Windows Engine.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour jouer, installe Steam pour Windows dans Réglages › Moteur Windows."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top sellers on Steam": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meilleures ventes sur Steam"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam の売上上位"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam 热销"
          }
        }
